{
  "scenario_spec_version": 1,
  "scenario_id": "prototype_pump_validation",
  "title": "Prototype Pump Activation Review",
  "description": "Ari is the validation engineer, Mara is the coordinator, and Bo operates a prototype pump. Their shared concern is whether it is safe to activate. The pump initially fails validation. Ari knows the private test detail; Mara has received an attributable short report that validation failed; Bo has received no failure report. Reviews, reports, technical state, personal interpretation, assent, and the activation hold are distinct. Ari may repair the pump and perform authorized revalidation. Activation requires Mara's and Bo's own recorded assents after the technical condition passes.",
