      "disposition": "Careful about distinguishing measured results from conclusions.",
      "memories": [
        "Knows the public procedure for prototype pump activation.",
        "Knows validation batch V17 failed: sensor channel C drifted 8 units.",
        "Knows Mara received a short report that validation failed.",
        "Has not sent Bo a failure report."
